    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'In this game, there is a graph and the ability to place bets. The user
    presses the Play button, and the graph appears. The user wins if the coefficient
    at the top is greater than 1.0 and loses if it is less. There is a pause between
    games.


    Below the bet, three tabs are displayed: Live Players, Previous,
    and Top Results.


    The Live Players tab shows current bets and the players
    placing them.

    The Previous tab displays past players.

    The Top Results
    tab shows the best bets and winnings of players.'
